<section id="install" aria-labelledby="install-heading">
  <h2 id="install-heading">Install</h2>
  <p>Install from PyPI:</p>
  <pre><code>pip install desktop-2fa</code></pre>
  <p>Basic usage:</p>
  <pre><code># Add a TOTP entry
desktop-2fa add

# Generate a code
desktop-2fa code &lt;account&gt;

# List all entries
desktop-2fa list</code></pre>
</section>